port: playback errors + track resume on launch (Phase 1 remainder)

- `MediaPlayer.playbackError` (ValueNotifier<String?>) now set on player
  errors instead of failing silently into "paused".
- `MediaPlayer.saveState` / `restoreLastPlayed` + `MediaPlayer.stop()`
  saves the current track to the new Hive box `QUEUE` (key `STATE`);
  `main()` opens the box and resumes the track on launch
  (`await GetIt.I<MediaPlayer>().restoreLastPlayed()`).
- Full-queue persistence (Android's queue across restarts) is still TODO.
- AlbumPage: `SectionItem(section: songsSection)` — un-necessary assertion.

